{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "思一样，对吧？Look等于have a look，对吧？Swim等于have a swim。OK，这是第一个点，希望各位拿到的。第二个点呢，就是have a swim那个变时态呢，你也要变，只不过是由have去变了，不由swim去变了，对吧？这十道题就是练一下这里啊，复习一下。OK，那不多说了。接下来呢，pattern drill呢，还是我们把pattern drill哎拉过来啊。这个我呢先把上面给各位讲完，各位下课自己往里面去带一带，对吧？我告诉各位，这里在尝试练我们什么样的语", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000027.webp", "time": 196.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Pattern drill", "训练目标：", "写作口语", "练习包含have的句子", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.93792, 0.96963, 0.99974, 0.99956, 0.998, 0.99931], "boxes": [[[91.0, 139.0], [369.0, 137.0], [369.0, 190.0], [91.0, 193.0]], [[147.0, 283.0], [377.0, 283.0], [377.0, 340.0], [147.0, 340.0]], [[146.0, 343.0], [358.0, 343.0], [358.0, 405.0], [146.0, 405.0]], [[146.0, 408.0], [613.0, 408.0], [613.0, 468.0], [146.0, 468.0]], [[32.0, 593.0], [248.0, 604.0], [245.0, 655.0], [29.0, 643.0]], [[638.0, 590.0], [826.0, 602.0], [822.0, 657.0], [634.0, 645.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000028.webp", "time": 201.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Pattern drill", "1 T: some more soup", "S1: Have some more soup!", "S2: No thanks. I've had enough.", "some more salad", "some more tea", "another piece of cake", "another bowl of soup", "another sandwich", "another biscuit", "some more coffee", "some more fish"], "scores": [0.98718, 0.97412, 0.96279, 0.97705, 0.99689, 0.97734, 0.98221, 0.97614, 0.98351, 0.99489, 0.9814, 0.99135], "boxes": [[[91.0, 136.0], [370.0, 135.0], [370.0, 193.0], [91.0, 194.0]], [[148.0, 284.0], [658.0, 295.0], [657.0, 348.0], [147.0, 336.0]], [[144.0, 345.0], [795.0, 353.0], [795.0, 412.0], [144.0, 405.0]], [[141.0, 407.0], [899.0, 411.0], [899.0, 480.0], [141.0, 475.0]], [[142.0, 497.0], [547.0, 490.0], [548.0, 547.0], [143.0, 553.0]], [[673.0, 502.0], [1025.0, 500.0], [1025.0, 547.0], [673.0, 549.0]], [[143.0, 574.0], [652.0, 571.0], [652.0, 634.0], [143.0, 637.0]], [[699.0, 569.0], [1199.0, 577.0], [1198.0, 640.0], [698.0, 632.0]], [[146.0, 658.0], [557.0, 656.0], [557.0, 710.0], [146.0, 712.0]]